1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:06,000
I am going to ask you five questions about your
practice. Answer honestly. Nobody is watching.

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:11,500
One. Without opening anything, how many active
clients do you have right now?

3
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:19,500
Two. How many of them have not logged
a meal in seven days?

4
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:26,500
Three. Which client's payment failed last month?

5
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Four. What is your monthly recurring revenue?
This month, not last quarter.

6
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:44,000
Five. If you stopped working for two weeks, would
your clients still be following their plans?

7
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:53,500
If you could not answer those in ten seconds,
you do not have a practice problem.

8
00:00:53,500 --> 00:00:56,500
You have an instrumentation problem.

9
00:00:57,500 --> 00:01:02,000
You are a good clinician running on tools
that were never built to run a clinic.

10
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:07,500
Here is what the same five questions
look like inside NUSI.

11
00:01:08,500 --> 00:01:12,000
Active clients: on the overview, live.

12
00:01:14,500 --> 00:01:21,000
Who has gone quiet: the clients-needing-attention
roll-up, with an at-risk list ranked by days silent.

13
00:01:22,500 --> 00:01:29,000
Failed payments: dunning handles the retry,
and tells you before the client churns.

14
00:01:30,500 --> 00:01:34,500
Revenue: the MRR breakdown, with the trend.

15
00:01:36,500 --> 00:01:40,500
And if you disappear for two weeks,
your programs keep running.

16
00:01:40,500 --> 00:01:45,500
Daily tasks still land. Habits still streak.
Automations still nudge.

17
00:01:49,500 --> 00:01:52,000
That last one is the whole product, really.

18
00:01:52,500 --> 00:01:57,500
Because a plan a client follows is worth
ten plans you wrote beautifully.

19
00:01:58,500 --> 00:02:02,000
NUSI is built for Indian practices specifically.

20
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:07,500
IFCT-2017 food data with cooking-retention science,
so cooked dal is not counted as raw dal.

21
00:02:07,500 --> 00:02:12,000
GST-compliant invoices. Razorpay subscriptions.
WhatsApp notifications. Rupee pricing.

22
00:02:12,500 --> 00:02:17,000
Starter is ₹3,999 a month, for 100 clients.

23
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:23,000
Growth is ₹8,999, for 500 clients, 5 team
members, and 5,000 AI credits a month.

24
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:28,000
Scale Pro is ₹19,999,
for unlimited clients and team.

25
00:02:28,500 --> 00:02:32,000
Fourteen days free. No card.

26
00:02:35,500 --> 00:02:41,000
Ask yourself those five questions again in two weeks.
See if the answers come faster.

27
00:02:43,500 --> 00:02:48,000
nusi.in — Run your practice, not your admin.
